WEBVTT

1
00:00.200 --> 00:02.300
This neural material looks beautifully real.

2
00:02.350 --> 00:03.800
So what does it take to train one?

3
00:03.850 --> 00:05.250
Training data: real cloth,

4
00:05.300 --> 00:06.230
from many views,

5
00:06.280 --> 00:07.710
under many lights.

6
00:08.000 --> 00:11.910
We use two robot arms: one moves the camera, one moves the light,

7
00:12.200 --> 00:16.050
capturing 580 views per cloth, 500 cloths in total.

8
00:16.100 --> 00:17.850
Eighty billion observations.

9
00:17.900 --> 00:19.480
This is RoboCloth.
